    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>&#952;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>6</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>&#952;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#183;</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>&#952;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>sin</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>cos</mi><mo>&#8289;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p>Now using the concept&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><msup><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></mrow></mfenced></math>, we can write</p><p>Maximum value of <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>5</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>75</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>19</mn></msqrt></math></p></blockquote>",
